.TH ALX-LINK 1 "November 2026" "Algothix OS 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
alx-link \- cross-device pairing and workspace sharing for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B alx-link pair
\fB\-\-listen\fR [\fB\-\-code\fR \fIPIN\fR]
.br
.B alx-link pair
\fIhost\fR \fB\-\-code\fR \fIPIN\fR
.br
.B alx-link status
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
.br
.B alx-link send
\fIfile\fR [\fIpeer\fR]
.br
.B alx-link clip
\fIpeer\fR
.br
.B alx-link run
\fIpeer\fR \fB\-\-\fR \fIcommand...\fR
.br
.B alx-link unpair
\fIpeer\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B alx-link
pairs Algothix OS machines over LAN/WireGuard/Tailscale using a one-time 6-digit
HMAC-SHA256 confirmation code, exchanging SSH keys, configuring Syncthing
(\fI~/ALX-Sync\fR at idle I/O priority), and generating Input Leap keyboard/mouse
sharing layouts.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/alx/link.conf
.br
.I ~/.config/alx-link/peers/*.json
.br
.I ~/.config/alx-link/input-leap.conf
.br
.I ~/.ssh/config.d/alx-link-*.conf
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ssh (1),
.BR tmux (1),
.BR syncthing (1)
